.TH "Docv::Viewer::Picker::Outline::Node" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Viewer::Picker::Outline::Node \- A row of the outline: a group (\fIitem\fR is \-1) of \fIsize\fR items sharing \fIprefix\fR, or the item \fIitem\fR.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::Viewer::Picker::Outline::Node\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A row of the outline: a group (\fIitem\fR is \-1) of \fIsize\fR items
sharing \fIprefix\fR, or the item \fIitem\fR. \fIparent\fR is the group it is
in (\-1 at the top) and \fIdepth\fR its nesting level; a group\(aqs
\fIchildren\fR are node ids in outline order. \fItext\fR is the row\(aqs name
relative to its group: the prefix or the item label without its
first \fIskip\fR characters.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(prefix : String, item : Int32, parent : Int32, depth : Int32, size : Int32, children : Array(Int32), text : String, skip : Int32)\fR
